adobe-xmp-toolkit-sdk provides CMake targets:

    find_package(EXPAT CONFIG REQUIRED)
    find_package(ZLIB CONFIG REQUIRED)

The XMP Toolkit SDK provides two main libraries:
- XMPCore: Core library for parsing, manipulating, and serializing XMP metadata
- XMPFiles: Library for locating, adding, or updating XMP metadata in files

Both libraries are built and installed by this port. Link against them using:
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE XMPCore XMPFiles)

Note: The XMP Toolkit SDK uses expat and zlib as dependencies, which are
automatically handled by vcpkg.
